  "theorem": {
    "proved": true,
    "theorem": "L/A is the direct sum over d=1..m-2 of the degree-d binary-form relation kernels, of dimensions m-d-1.  Thus [L:A]=p^C(m-1,2), [L:B]=p^C(m,2), and det L=2p^(m^2).",
